# The container build context is the monorepo root, but only the two Python
# packages are needed.  Ignore everything, then re-include those, then drop
# their local state and build junk.
*
!openatsc3-pki/
!openatsc3-ca/

**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.egg-info/
**/.pytest_cache/
openatsc3-ca/.venv-ca/
openatsc3-ca/.pgdata*/
openatsc3-ca/ca-tree/
openatsc3-ca/staticfiles/
openatsc3-ca/deliveries/
openatsc3-ca/tests/
